{"pr": 38717, "type": "improvements", "branch": "8.2.x", "title": "Use v8 documentation in HelperCard", "url": "https://github.com/PrestaShop/PrestaShop/pull/38717", "issue": 37990, "issue_title": "BO - When no credit slip exists, the link to the documentation is obsolete", "issue_body": "### Prerequisites\n\n- [x] I understand and accept the project's [code of conduct](https://github.com/PrestaShop/PrestaShop/blob/develop/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md).\n- [x] I have already [searched in existing issues](https://github.com/PrestaShop/PrestaShop/issues?q=is%3Aissue+label%3ABug) and found no previous report of this bug.\n\n### Describe the bug and add attachments\n\nWhen I go to my credit slip page, if I don't have any, the link to the documentation is for 1.7. It is obsolete.\n\n<img width=\"1435\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/803f2ca9-2093-4e17-9ee2-42d2e6de549c\" />\n\n### Expected behavior\n\nIt should be updated with the latest documentation available.\n\nFor v8 it is available : https://docs.prestashop-project.org/v.8-documentation/user-guide/selling/managing-orders/credit-slips\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Go to BO > Orders > Credit slips\n2. No credit slip available\n3. Click the link \"Learn more\"\n4. See obsolete documentation :x:\n\n### PrestaShop version(s) where the bug happened\n\n9.0.0\n\n### PHP version(s) where the bug happened\n\n8.2\n\n### If your bug is related to a module, specify its name and its version\n\n_No response_\n\n### Your company or customer's name goes here (if applicable).\n\n_No response_", "base_commit": "5bef8431babb60f8829c19a7e9353fc46d0a9453", "merge_commit": "ccf1a65b3bfac1a9347a6ad1c76babc714cc2b16", "files": ["src/PrestaShopBundle/Resources/config/services/core/util/helper_card.yml"], "lines": 84, "labels": ["Improvement", "QA ✔️", "8.2.x"]}
